# Agent process

Read `PROCESS.md` before implementing a Work Order.

- Branch `wo/NNN-slug`; first commit is `docs/factory/runs/WO-NNN.json`
- Verify with `make ci-local` and `make run` (http://localhost:8765)
- P0/P1: do not auto-merge; P2: auto-merge after CI
- Never `git add -A`; never skip the human UI checkpoint for P0–P2
